entry='<article class="paper-row" id="source-work-v01"><div class="paper-number">G21</div><div><span class="eyebrow">Conditional theorem manuscript · development 0.1</span><h2>Controlled source and implementation work</h2><p>Norm variation, parameter drift and tangent defects share a cumulative confinement budget.</p><p class="muted">A moving-reference energy proof charges base norm gain, while pure loss still spends the amplitude allowance and can create Gauss charge. Defect work must be bounded at every time prefix; terminal cancellation is insufficient. The exact matrix source equation, raw-forcing conversion and constant-rate horizon inequality are supplied. Forty-three exact checks and separate matrix diagnostics pass. Independent review pending; physical promotion 0. This is a continuous trajectory contract, not a physical source construction, constraint repair or arbitrary-integrator guarantee.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href="'+link+files[2]+'">Read theorem PDF ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="'+link+z.name+'">Proof and source/work contract ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="/sources/?id=SDW01">Claims and scope →</a></div></div></article>'
